 dynasty (1750–79)</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h2"><li data-target="#ref32181"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/The-Qajar-dynasty-1796-1925">The Qajar dynasty (1796–1925)</a><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref32182"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/The-Qajar-dynasty-1796-1925#ref32182">The age of imperialism</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref32183"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/The-Qajar-dynasty-1796-1925#ref32183">Popular protest and the Constitutional Revolution</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref32184"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/Rise-of-Reza-Khan">Rise of Reza Khan</a></li></ul></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h2"><li data-target="#ref32185"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/Rise-of-Reza-Khan#ref32185">The Pahlavi dynasty (1925–79)</a><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref32186"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/Rise-of-Reza-Khan#ref32186">Reza Shah</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref32187"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/Wartime-and-nationalization-of-oil">Wartime and nationalization of oil</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref230077"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/The-White-Revolution">The White Revolution</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref230078"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/The-White-Revolution#ref230078">Protest and failure</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref230079"><a class="w-100 link-gray-900" href="/place/Iran/The-White-Revolution#ref230079">Foreign relations</a></li></ul><ul class="list-unstyled" data-level="h3"><li data-target="#ref230088"><a class="w-100 link-gray-9